# Data license

The dataset splits under `data/splits/` and the run records under `runs/` are
released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: RECLAIM Authors.

The run records contain model-generated transcripts and grader output.

The papers and artifacts the splits point at remain under their own licenses.

The code in this repository is covered separately by `LICENSE`.
